            "level": {
              "value": 14
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You transform reflexively when in danger. You cast untamed form to transform into one shape granted by one of the prerequisite feats you have, depending on the trigger. Your shape's resistances and weaknesses apply against the triggering damage.\n\n- **Trigger** You fall 10 feet or more; **Effect** Choose a form from aerial form.\n- **Trigger** You take acid, cold, electricity, fire, or poison damage; **Effect** Choose a form from dragon form that resists the triggering damage.\n- **Trigger** You take fire damage; **Effect** Choose a fire elemental form from elemental form.\n- **Trigger** You take poison damage; **Effect** Choose a form from plant form."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
